   "t": 129.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/ppppbppp/2n5/8/2BpP3/2P2N2/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "c3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The natural dxc3 is a blunder — a famous trap. Qd5 threatens mate on f7, and the only defence, the knight to h6, just drops the knight. So we can't take."
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 191,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/ppppbppp/2n5/8/2B1P3/2Pp1N2/PP3PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "d3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Instead, hand the pawn back on our own terms — d3, denying White a dominant centre."
