   "line": [
    "d6",
    "Qxc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "And if White switches the move order — the bishop takes on f7 first, then the check on d5 — he doesn't win a piece, but the material equalises and Black's king is left permanently exposed.",
   "reanchor": true
  },
